title: 'Symphony Phase 0: A-Mail agent-to-agent messaging'
summary: Implemented Symphony Phase 0 — file-based agent-to-agent messaging (A-Mail) for multi-session Claude Code collaboration. Created symphony-loader with JSONL mailbox I/O, agent identity, threads, and human-gated file pipeline. Added 6 MCP tools, 16 CLI commands under `paradigm mail`, and full university content (lesson, 12 PLSAT variants, reference cards).
