commit: 8dc63847
decisions:
  - id: D1
    decision: Mailbox at ~/.paradigm/mail/ not ~/.conductor/
    rationale: A-Mail works without Conductor — separate directory avoids coupling
  - id: D2
    decision: Agent identity = {project}/{role} from config.yaml
    rationale: Deterministic IDs survive session restarts, unlike PID-based
  - id: D3
    decision: JSONL for messages with append-only writes
    rationale: Atomic on POSIX for small writes, no locking needed
  - id: D4
    decision: Relative import path from CLI to MCP loader
    rationale: paradigm-mcp has no sub-path exports; tsup noExternal bundles relative imports correctly
  - id: D5
    decision: TCP serve as Phase 0 stub
    rationale: Placeholder for remote linking — full protocol deferred to later phase
